flowchart TD
  A[Owner types request and presses Send] --> B{Nonempty and no active run?}
  B -- No --> Z[No new run]
  B -- Yes --> C{Phone awake and unlocked; requests enabled?}
  C -- No --> D[Park request; ask owner to unlock / enable]
  D -- Cancel --> Z
  D -- Unlock --> C
  C -- Yes --> E[Create run ID, elapsed timer and cancellation state]
  E --> F{Real core available and model configured?}
  F -- No --> G[Explicitly labelled scripted demo]
  F -- Yes --> H[Call Rust core.run through Kotlin / UniFFI]
  H --> I[Core owns the task cycle: see next diagram]
  I --> J[Return status, execution evidence and result to UI]
  G --> J
